// The randomizer's in-game smokes (docs/RANDOMIZER_PLAN.md, "Tests"), run as
//   native/tools/run.sh rando [--stage ...] --env COS_RANDO_SMOKE=<name>
// pc_rando_smokes.cpp includes this list as an X-macro: PC_RANDO_SMOKE(<name>, <function>), where
// <name> is the COS_RANDO_SMOKE value and <function> is pc::<function>(unsigned int frames),
// defined in that step's own smokes/pc_rando_smoke_<name>.cpp and called every game frame
// (pc_rando_smokes.h). Append-only: each step adds one line; on a merge keep both sides.
PC_RANDO_SMOKE(null, randoSmokeNull) // R0.1: the switch, the defaults and activation
PC_RANDO_SMOKE(text, randoSmokeText) // R4.2: the text input (seed grid through the menu, permalink import)
